    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2CH:1:13",
      "sequence": 11208,
      "chapter_label": "2CH 1",
      "verse_label": "13",
      "locator": {
        "book": "2CH",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 13
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "So Solomon came from the high place that was at Gibeon, from before the Tent of Meeting, to Jerusalem; and he reigned over Israel.",
      "ko": "이에 솔로몬이 기브온 산당 회막 앞에서부터 예루살렘으로 돌아와서 이스라엘을 치리하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8f56630c113b67fead5590f07cff9b82bc99dd998c972f4ec6e82911a32ce245",
