      "en": "The horses which Solomon had were brought out of Egypt and from Kue. The king’s merchants purchased them from Kue.",
      "ko": "솔로몬의 말들은 애굽에서 내어 왔으니 왕의 상고들이 떼로 정가하여 산 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "de9401099e0f8193b974914be49d32de218014141a9645dc0a73d2bf0805c2f0",
      "translation_text_hash": "f4c766f2851c6cb9a051b545a8776a6973617baac4db809c67608924c36e1a5f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
